Z||000011||stimpy||11-07-2000||01:16 AM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by 2M4 Dale:<BR><B>Gore=Democrat=big government=higher taxes=less freedom<P>nothing personal my friend !!!<P>Oh and one more thing....<BR>Reagan/Bush-Democratic controlled Congress<BR>Clinton/Gore-Republican controlled Congress<P>Who should get the credit ????<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>According to you, Republicans credit for everything good, Democrats the blame for everything bad.  It's so nice when everything is painted in black and white. Let's see, Iran-Contra... must have been that Democratically controlled congress that <B>made</B> the Reagan adnistration commit high treason. <BR>The most scandelous thing that y'all are coming up with on Clinton is that he liked to get a little? Millions of dollars spent trying to impeach a President that we re-elected <B>knowing</B> that he fooled around? I guess that is a burden to be shared by every Democrat too.  Open up <B>your</B> eyes. Cause it's obvious that you don't get it either. <p>[This message has been edited by stimpy (edited 11-07-2000).]||||reg||1
